  "details": "When you search for something. You can't click on users profile image in the mixed search results. But you can for other types of results.\n\n1. open your menu.\n\n2. search for something that would return an assortment of different results.\n\n3. Under the user tab everything works as expected.\n\n4. swap over to the All tab.\n\n5. Try clicking on the users image. It won't open the profile.\n\n6. Try clicking on the small user tab over the image and the profile will open.\n\nvideo showing the problem: https://youtu.be/HSTfOqmZUZQ",
